(gen x1 (gen x2 (gen x3 (gen x4 (lam h5 (ex x6 (= (+ x1 (s x6)) x3)) (lam h7 (ex x8 (= (+ x2 (s x8)) x4)) (unpack h7 (gen x9 (lam h10 (= (+ x2 (s x9)) x4) (app (app (inst (inst (inst (use 19) (+ (* x1 x4) x2)) (+ (* x1 x4) x4)) (* x3 x4)) (wit x11 (= (+ (+ (* x1 x4) x2) (s x11)) (+ (* x1 x4) x4)) x9 (app (app (inst (inst (inst (use 0) (+ (+ (* x1 x4) x2) (s x9))) (+ (* x1 x4) (+ x2 (s x9)))) (+ (* x1 x4) x4)) (inst (inst (inst (use 1) x2) (s x9)) (* x1 x4))) (eqelim x12 (= (+ (* x1 x4) (+ x2 (s x9))) (+ (* x1 x4) x12)) h10 (refl (+ (* x1 x4) (+ x2 (s x9)))))))) (eqelim x13 (ex x14 (= (+ x13 x14) (* x3 x4))) (inst (inst (use 6) (* x1 x4)) x4) (app (inst (inst (inst (use 11) (s x1)) x3) x4) (app (inst (inst (use 15) x1) x3) h5)))))))))))))
